cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the associated datasets, please cite the article below."
title: "Predicting Commercialization Success of Renewable-Energy Patents"
abstract: >-
  A hybrid multimodal framework combining transformer text embeddings
  (BERT/ELECTRA) with gradient boosting (XGBoost/LightGBM) to predict
  patent commercialization success, measured as assignment frequency,
  for USPTO Y02E renewable-energy patents (2014-2023).
type: software
